entries[205813] = { ["name"] = "Thunderpads of the Cinderwolf", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nShoulder Mail\n710 Armor\n+353 [Agility or Intellect]\n+1,082 Stamina\n+ 173 Critical Strike\n+ 391 Haste\nDurability 100 / 100\nClasses: Shaman\nRunes of the Cinderwolf (0/5)\nAdornments of the Cinderwolf\nKnuckles of the Cinderwolf\nSpangenhelm of the Cinderwolf\nBraies of the Cinderwolf\nThunderpads of the Cinderwolf\n(2) Set Elemental: Gain Stormkeeper every 50 sec.\n(2) Set Enhancement: Sundering increases your Mastery by (12 * 2 )% for 15 sec.\n(2) Set Restoration: When you cast Healing Rain, each ally with your Riptide on them is area healed by Tidewaters for (322% of Spell Power).\n(4) Set Elemental: For 8 sec after you consume Stormkeeper, your Lightning Bolt, Lava Burst, Icefury, and Frost Shock generate 50% more Maelstrom, and your Chain Lightning, Lava Beam, and Earthquake deal 20% increased critical damage.\n(4) Set Enhancement: Sundering increases your Physical and Fire damage dealt by 20% for 15 sec and your next 2 Chain Lightning casts deal 20% increased damage and refund 50% of Maelstrom Weapon stacks consumed.\n(4) Set Restoration: Each ally healed by Tidewaters increases your healing done by 1.0% for 8 sec and increases the healing of your next Healing Wave or Healing Surge by 10%, or your next Chain Heal by 2%.\nSell Price:" }
